# Vel2Grid template of the example model: a 2D grid (distance, depth) 200 km across and
# 60 km deep at 0.25 km, the velocities of velocity.in. yanll fills @MODEL@, @PHASE@ and
# @CONFIG@ and runs it once per phase when the model grid is missing.
CONTROL 1 54321
TRANS SIMPLE 45.0 10.0 0.0
VGOUT @MODEL@
VGTYPE @PHASE@
VGGRID 2 801 241 0.0 0.0 -2.0 0.25 0.25 0.25 SLOW_LEN
INCLUDE @CONFIG@/velocity.in
GTMODE GRID2D ANGLES_NO
